  its own license as shipped upstream.

Modifications from upstream Artemis:
- Application ID changed to app.vibewindow.client and app name to Vibe Window.
- Default resolution 1920x1080, default frame rate 120 FPS, virtual display
  on by default.
- New "Show only the app window" setting that adds windowOnly=1 to host
  launch and resume requests.
- Crash log email recipient removed.
- Release builds are arm64-v8a only and signed with a public CI key.
